  "bodyHash": "AJDRK60CQ30=",
  "content": "<h1><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/695/948/sbt_banner.png\" alt=\"Logo\" width=\"722\" height=\"183\"></h1><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">這個模組讓你在物品欄中將滑鼠懸停在界伏盒上時，按下<code>Shift</code>鍵即可預覽其內容。</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:36px;font-family:&amp;#x27\"><strong>同時支援 Fabric 與 MinecraftForge</strong></span></h2><p>&nbsp;</p><h2><span style=\"font-size:36px;font-family:&amp;#x27\"><strong><strong>下載</strong></strong></span></h2><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"> <strong><strong>Fabric:</strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/shulkerboxtooltip/files/6678389\" rel=\"nofollow\">1.21.7</a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/shulkerboxtooltip/files/5639021\" rel=\"nofollow\">1.20.6</a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/shulkerboxtooltip/files/4827832\" rel=\"nofollow\">1.19.4</a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/shulkerboxtooltip/files/4827838\" rel=\"nofollow\">1.18.2</a> （舊版：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/shulkerboxtooltip/files/3999638\" rel=\"nofollow\">1.17.1</a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/shulkerboxtooltip/files/3999663\" rel=\"nofollow\">1.16.5</a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/shulkerboxtooltip/files/2975404\" rel=\"nofollow\">1.15.2</a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/shulkerboxtooltip/files/2788715\" rel=\"nofollow\">1.14.4</a>）</strong> </span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong><strong>MinecraftForge</strong>: <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/shulkerboxtooltip/files/6678391\" rel=\"nofollow\">1.21.7</a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/shulkerboxtooltip/files/5639022\" rel=\"nofollow\">1.20.6</a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/shulkerboxtooltip/files/4827833\" rel=\"nofollow\">1.19.4</a> <a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/shulkerboxtooltip/files/4827839\" rel=\"nofollow\">1.18.2</a> </strong> </span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>NeoForge:&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/shulkerboxtooltip/files/6678392\" rel=\"nofollow\">1.21.7</a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/shulkerboxtooltip/files/5639023\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">1.20.6</span></a></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p><h3><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>在 Fabric 上：</strong></span></h3><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://fabricmc.net/use/\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric Loader</a> 與 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric</a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\" rel=\"nofollow\"> API</a> 為必要安裝</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/modmenu\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mod Menu</a> 建議安裝（但非必要）以進行遊戲內設定</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p><h2 style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:36px;font-family:&amp;#x27\"><strong>功能特色</strong></span></h2><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:24px\">精簡預覽</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">在物品上懸停時按下<code>Shift</code>（預設按鍵）。</span></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/285/159/compact_preview_2.png\" alt=\"精簡預覽圖片\" width=\"465\" height=\"262\"></p><h3>&nbsp;</h3><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:24px\">完整預覽</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">在物品上懸停時按下<code>Alt+Shift</code>（預設按鍵），可顯示完整內容，每個物品格將正確顯示在對應欄位。</span></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/285/163/full_preview_1.png\" alt=\"完整預覽圖片\" width=\"464\" height=\"254\"></p><h3>&nbsp;</h3><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:24px\">其他容器</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:16px\">此預覽功能亦適用於在創造模式下使用 Ctrl+選取方塊取得的物品，例如箱子、熔爐、桶子等。</span><br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:16px\">也相容於大多數模組新增的容器。</span></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/285/160/other_containers_preview.png\" alt=\"其他容器預覽圖片\" width=\"464\" height=\"261\"></p><h3>&nbsp;</h3><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:24px\">戰利品表</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:16px\">若懸停的物品設有戰利品表，其名稱將會顯示在提示文字中。</span><br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:16px\">此選項預設為關閉。</span></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/285/169/loot_table_tooltip_info.png\" alt=\"戰利品表資訊圖片\" width=\"467\" height=\"262\"></p><h3>&nbsp;</h3><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:24px\">可設定性</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">模組的大部分功能都可透過設定選單進行調整。若要進入設定，請在<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/modmenu\" rel=\"nofollow\">模組選單</a>中選擇<code>ShulkerBoxTooltip</code>，然後點選齒輪圖示。</span><br><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">關於每個選項的詳細說明，請參閱遊戲內文件或<a href=\"https://github.com/MisterPeModder/ShulkerBoxTooltip/wiki/Configuration-Options\" rel=\"nofollow\">Wiki</a>。設定檔位於 <code>&lt;minecraft資料夾&gt;/config/shulkerboxtooltip.json5</code></span></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/900/95/config-mk2.png\" alt=\"設定畫面圖片\" width=\"474\" height=\"248\"></p><h3>&nbsp;</h3><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:24px\">顏色！</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">預覽視窗的顏色會根據界伏盒的顏色而改變，您可以在設定中關閉此功能。</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:24px\">伺服器支援</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">此模組也可安裝在伺服器端（選擇性），以提供額外功能，如終界箱預覽。</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
